  m_text: '<size=25>GOAL</size>

    is to find the SPELL of the day with the <i>least</i>
    amount of STRAIN possible. Guess it by finding and typing HEXED RUNES into the
    WORD SPELLER. It''s always made out of 5 or 6 RUNES.

'
